//- DIRECTIVES TAB RIGHT RAIL - THE {placeholder} REFERENCE, GROUPED BY
//- SCOPE: THE UNIVERSAL SET FILLS IN EVERY DIRECTIVE (PROMPT BLOCKS AND
//- TOOL BRIEFINGS ALIKE); REPLY-TIME VARS EXIST ONLY WHILE A DISCORD REPLY
//- IS BEING BUILT AND NAME THE DIRECTIVES THAT ADD THEM. EACH ROW = BRACE
//- TOKEN, WHAT IT FILLS WITH, AND THE VALUE IT RESOLVES TO RIGHT NOW
//- (reply-TIME VARS SHOW A NOTE INSTEAD). SAME #memberContainer ID-REUSE
//- CONVENTION AS THE THREADS RAIL, SO EVERY SWAP PATH RESTORES CLEANLY.
//- LOCALS: aiVarsRail { universal: [row], reply: [row] },
//- row = { key, blurb, scope, usedBy, now }
mixin varRow(varDoc)
  .aiVarRow
    code.aiVarToken {#{varDoc.key}}
    .aiVarBlurb= varDoc.blurb
    .aiVarNow
      span.aiVarNowLabel now
      if varDoc.now
        if varDoc.now.icon
          img.aiVarNowIcon(src=varDoc.now.icon alt="")
        span.aiVarNowValue= varDoc.now.text
      else
        span.aiVarNowValue.aiVarNowDynamic filled per reply
    if varDoc.usedBy.length
      .aiVarUsedBy= `Only in: ${varDoc.usedBy.join(', ')}`

div.memberContainer.aiVarsRail#memberContainer(
  hx-select-oob="#memberContainer"
  hx-swap-oob="outerHTML"
)
  span.memberListHeader Template variables
  .aiVarsBlurb Drop these into any directive - they fill in when the text is used, and unknown braces pass through untouched.
  .aiVarsGroupHead Available everywhere
  each varDoc in aiVarsRail.universal
    +varRow(varDoc)
  .aiVarsGroupHead Reply-time only
  .aiVarsGroupHint These only exist while a Discord reply is being built.
  each varDoc in aiVarsRail.reply
    +varRow(varDoc)
